[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Mrs. Smith's Kitchen]
[00:00.54]Lesson 25 | 第25课
[00:02.72]Mrs. Smith's Kitchen | 史密斯太太的厨房
[00:06.01]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.84]What colour is the electric cooker? | 电炉是什么颜色的？
[00:17.25]Mrs. Smith's kitchen is small. | 史密斯太太的厨房很小。
[00:22.50]There is a refrigerator in the kitchen. | 厨房里有台冰箱。
[00:27.48]The refrigerator is white. | 冰箱是白色的。
[00:31.14]It is on the right. | 它在右边。
[00:34.50]There is an electric cooker in the kitchen. | 厨房里有个电炉。
[00:39.48]The cooker is blue. | 电炉是蓝色的。
[00:41.90]It is on the left. | 它在左边。
[00:45.64]There is a table in the middle of the room. | 房间的中间有张桌子。
[00:50.93]There is a bottle on the table. | 桌子上有个瓶子。
[00:54.84]The bottle is empty. | 瓶子是空的。
[00:58.40]There is a cup on the table, too. | 桌子上也有个杯子。
[01:03.25]The cup is clean. | 杯子是干净的。